  "description": "SOLEIL Electric Bike FeaturesSOLEIL features both Pedal Assistance and a Throttle, so you can pedal as much as you want, or press the thumb throttle and let the motor do 100% of the work for you. It also features a rear disc brake for significantly improved traction over other CTB's on the industry. This is the safest, most comfortable, and most feature full city e-bike available.At just 55lbs, this lightweight bike is easy to ride and maneuver. The polished welds add to it’s beauty and simplicity. LCD Display The backlit LCD display is your communication center. Here, you will find your speed, power assist (PAS) level, battery level, and odometer. This multifunctional display is weather resistant and includes a USB charging port Speed Shifter SOLEIL comes standard equipped with the Shimano Altus Derailleur, Shimano 7-speed gearing, and thumb throttle. Motor Power With the SOLEIL, power meets efficiency. The 500W (700W Peak) rear hub motor provides quick and smooth acceleration. The high-efficient motor will take you to new places and provide miles of enjoyment. Range SOLEIL includes a 10.4Ah Lithium-Ion battery that mounts inside the bike frame. It can deliver up to 30 miles on a single charge and the charging time is just 4-6 hours. You can charge your battery while in the bike or remove the battery to charge it independently. Accessories SOLEIL has front and rear fenders, front suspension, headlight, tail light, and rear cargo rack.",
